  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほほの　でんきぶくろは　みはったつ。まえあしの　にくきゅうで　けんめいに　こするとようやく　はつでんできる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "볼의 전기 주머니가 아직 발달하지 않았다. 앞발의 볼록살을 열심히 비벼야 겨우 전기가 만들어진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "臉頰上的電囊尚未發達。必須拼命摩擦前腳的肉球，才終於能製造出電力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les poches sur ses joues sont peu développées. Elles ne produisent de l’électricité que lorsqu’il les frotte avec ses coussinets.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine elektrischen Backentaschen sind nicht ganz ausgebildet. Um Strom zu erzeugen, muss es mit den Ballen der Vorderpfoten kräftig daran reiben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Como las bolsas de sus mejillas están poco desarrolladas, genera electricidad frotándolas con las almohadillas de sus patas delanteras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sacche elettriche sulle sue guance non si sono sviluppate del tutto e per generare energia deve sfregarle vigorosamente con le zampe anteriori.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has underdeveloped electric sacs on its cheeks. These sacs can produce electricity only if Pawmi rubs them furiously with the pads on its forepaws.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頬の　電気袋は　未発達。前脚の　肉球で　懸命に　擦るとようやく　発電できる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "脸颊上的电囊尚未发达。必须拼命摩擦前脚的肉球才得以制造出电力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Como las bolsas de sus mejillas están poco desarrolladas, genera electricidad frotándolas con las almohadillas de sus patas delanteras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ての　にくきゅうが　ほうでんきかん。うしろあしで　ようやく　たちあがるとてのひらから　でんげきを　はなつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "손의 볼록살이 방전 기관이다. 뒷발로 겨우 일어선 다음 손바닥에서 전격을 내보낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "手的肉球是放電的器官。會費勁地用後腳站起來，然後從手掌釋放出電擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses coussinets servent à projeter de l’électricité. Quand il parvient à se tenir sur ses pattes arrière, il envoie des décharges avec ses pattes avant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine Pfotenballen sind Organe zur elektrischen Entladung. Gelingt es ihm, auf den Hinterbeinen zu stehen, schießt es Strom aus den Vorderpfoten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus almohadillas le permiten liberar electricidad. Cuando logra erguirse sobre las patas traseras, usa las palmas para soltar descargas eléctricas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I cuscinetti delle zampe anteriori sono organi che scaricano elettricità. Quando riesce a stare sulle zampe posteriori può lanciare attacchi elettrici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The pads of its paws are electricity-discharging organs. Pawmi fires electricity from its forepaws while standing unsteadily on its hind legs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "手の　肉球が　放電器官。後ろ脚で　ようやく　立ち上がると手のひらから　電撃を　放つ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "手部的肉球是放电器官。努力用后脚站立起来，然后从手掌释放出电击。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus almohadillas le permiten liberar electricidad. Cuando logra erguirse sobre las patas traseras, usa las palmas para soltar descargas eléctricas.",
      "language": {
